      { question: "How do I know if I need a Class 3 or Class 4 gas cylinder?", answer: "Class 3 is rated for users up to 250 lbs. Class 4 is rated for 250-400 lbs. If you weigh over 250 lbs or the chair sinks quickly under load, upgrade to Class 4. A Class 4 cylinder costs $5-10 more but lasts significantly longer under heavy use." },
